{
  "name": "scummvm",
  "title": "ScummVM 0.6.1 (2004), with Beneath a Steel Sky -- C++ over SDL 1.2",
  "dir": "corpus/scummvm-0.6.1",
  "fetch": "curl -Lo /tmp/scummvm-0.6.1-src.tar.bz2 https://downloads.scummvm.org/frs/scummvm/0.6.1/scummvm-0.6.1-src.tar.bz2 && tar -xjf /tmp/scummvm-0.6.1-src.tar.bz2 -C corpus && node tools/scummvm-configure.mjs",
  "_doc": "The game engine interpreter of 2004, in C++: namespaces, class and function templates with value parameters, an explicit specialisation, pointers to member functions, a class with two polymorphic bases, dynamic_cast -- the subset src/cxx grew for it (P14.6). Its data is the freeware Beneath a Steel Sky (bass-cd-1.0.zip from the ScummVM project), outside the repository.",
